{"seq":6,"slug":"nutrition-cooking","title":"营养烹饪","stage":"DONE","category":"cooking-food-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking","rating":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.35,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 营养烹饪\n\n营养烹饪（Nutritional Cooking）是将循证营养科学原理系统应用于食物制备全过程的跨学科实践领域。它不仅关注食材的选择与搭配，更深入研究烹饪方法、温度控制、时间管理对营养素保留与生物利用度的影响机制，最终实现\"既好吃又营养\"的双重目标。\n\n## 学科定位\n\n营养烹饪处于食品科学、营养学与烹饪技艺的交叉地带。传统烹饪以感官品质（色、香、味、形）为核心追求，而营养烹饪在此基础上引入定量化的营养评价维度——通过理解蛋白质变性、淀粉糊化、维生素降解、矿物质溶出等化学过程，指导烹饪决策的优化。2025-2026 年的最新研究表明，烹饪方法对营养素保留的影响差异可达 40-70%，蒸制与微波加热相比传统水煮可保留 80-90% 的水溶性维生素。\n\n## 核心理念\n\n营养烹饪的核心理念可概括为三个层次：第一，**营养素保护**——在食物制备过程中最大限度地保留原料中的营养成分；第二，**生物利用度优化**——通过恰当的加工手段提高营养素的消化吸收率；第三，**膳食模式整合**——将单一食物的营养优化放入整体饮食模式中考量，实现系统性的健康收益。\n\n## 时代背景\n\n随着精准营养（Precision Nutrition）和肠道微生物组研究的快速发展，营养烹饪正从群体化建议走向个性化实践。营养基因组学揭示了基因多态性对营养素代谢的差异化影响，肠道菌群研究证实了饮食-微生物-宿主三方互作的复杂网络。这些前沿进展为营养烹饪提供了更精确的科学依据，也对从业者提出了更高的知识整合要求。\n\n## 章节导读\n\n本 Hub 从宏观到微观、从基础到前沿，系统覆盖营养烹饪的完整知识体系：\n\n- **宏量营养素科学**：深入蛋白质质量评价、碳水化合物血糖响应、膳食脂肪代谢三大基石，解析烹饪对宏量营养素功能特性的影响\n- **微量营养素保留**：聚焦维生素稳定性、矿物质生物利用度、植物化学物保护，提供基于烹饪方法的营养素保留策略\n- **膳食模式烹饪**：将地中海饮食、植物基营养、抗炎饮食等循证模式转化为可操作的烹饪实践\n- **精准营养烹饪**：探索营养基因组学、肠道微生物组、智能膳食规划等前沿方向如何重塑个性化营养烹饪实践\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macronutrient-science","title":"宏量营养素科学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/macronutrient-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protein-quality-cooking","title":"蛋白质质量与烹饪影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/macronutrient-science/protein-quality-cooking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbohydrate-glycemic","title":"碳水化合物与血糖响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/macronutrient-science/carbohydrate-glycemic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dietary-fat-metabolism","title":"膳食脂肪与代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/macronutrient-science/dietary-fat-metabolism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"micronutrient-retention","title":"微量营养素保留","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/micronutrient-retention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vitamin-stability","title":"维生素稳定性与烹饪损失","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/micronutrient-retention/vitamin-stability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mineral-bioavailability","title":"矿物质生物利用度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/micronutrient-retention/mineral-bioavailability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"phytochemical-preservation","title":"植物化学物保留","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/micronutrient-retention/phytochemical-preservation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"diet-pattern-cooking","title":"膳食模式烹饪","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/diet-pattern-cooking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mediterranean-diet-practice","title":"地中海饮食实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/diet-pattern-cooking/mediterranean-diet-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plant-based-nutrition","title":"植物基营养烹饪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/diet-pattern-cooking/plant-based-nutrition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anti-inflammatory-cooking","title":"抗炎饮食烹饪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/diet-pattern-cooking/anti-inflammatory-cooking"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"precision-nutrition-cooking","title":"精准营养烹饪","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/precision-nutrition-cooking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nutrigenomics-personalization","title":"营养基因组学与个性化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/precision-nutrition-cooking/nutrigenomics-personalization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gut-microbiome-diet","title":"肠道微生物组与饮食","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/nutrition-cooking/precision-nutrition-cooking/gut-microbiome-diet"},{"s